Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Lookahead Stitch Capacity Revision 0.1 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] cda95c35-0cde-4dcb-839c-1e33b839e3b5
@ [canonical_uuid] ed156338-1ab2-4e33-9fa3-72a24c899f87

& [Decision]
  + widen the parent stitch validation maximum to sixteen under a separate immutable revision

& [Why]
  + three is already a verified upstream result and one packet is required downstream
  + sixteen matches the bounded candidate surface and remains constrained by existing observation and 8192-byte limits

& [Rejected]
  + weaken RSP fixture to two because it would erase the discovered product seam
  + split into multiple packets because it breaks the signed one-envelope mapping
  + silently edit prior LAS spec because it destroys immutable justification history
  + raise unrelated limits because no evidence requires it
